OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with spells of rain or
OL,7,Fshowers Sunday and Monday. Rain in the
OL,8,Fsouth on Tuesday, with some hill snow
OL,9,Fpossible. Brighter with showers
OL,10,Felsewhere. Often windy and feeling
OL,11,Fcold.
